# Node
node_modules/
.next/
out/
# TypeScript's incremental build cache. Regenerated by every `tsc` run and by
# `next build`, so committing it meant an 86KB machine-specific blob churning in
# unrelated diffs -- and every typecheck left the tree dirty.
*.tsbuildinfo
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

